            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f3" n="26" xml:id="d440-f3-content">
                <p>Leo T. Crowley, Foreign Economic Administrator.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f4" n="27" xml:id="d440-f4-content">
                <p>Arthur Z. Gardiner, Director, Foreign Procurement and Development Branch FEA’s
                    Bureau of Supplies.</p>
            </note>
